| Parameter | Value | Basis |
|---|---|---|
| Volume | 36,000 reviews over 3 months; analyst time ≈ 22 min each | **Documented** ~12,000/month, 20+ min |
| Risk | ≈ 9.6% truly risky (higher for gaming, forex/crypto, nutraceuticals) | Our assumption |
